# HuggingFace token for pyannote speaker diarization models (required for --diarize)
# 1. Create account at huggingface.co
# 2. Accept license terms for:
#    - https://huggingface.co/pyannote/speaker-diarization-3.1
#    - https://huggingface.co/pyannote/segmentation-3.0
# 3. Generate token at https://huggingface.co/settings/tokens
# 4. Copy this file to .env and fill in your token
HF_TOKEN=hf_your_token_here
